sequenceDiagram
  actor E as Estudiante
  actor S as Soporte
  participant API
  participant DS as DisputeService
  participant D as Disputa
  participant P as Pago
  E->>API: POST /disputas
  API->>DS: report(session_id)
  DS->>DS: WithinDisputeWindow (≤ 24 h)
  DS-->>E: 201 abierta (due_at = +48 h)
  E->>API: POST /disputas/{id}/evidencia
  API->>D: attach_evidence()
  E->>API: POST /disputas/{id}/escalar
  API->>D: escalate()
  S->>API: POST /disputas/{id}/resolver (X-Role: soporte)
  API->>DS: resolve(responsable, decisión, % reembolso)
  DS->>D: resolve() exige evidencia
  alt sin evidencia
    D-->>S: 422 EVIDENCE_REQUIRED
  else con evidencia
    DS->>P: refund(motivo, evidencia, responsable)
    DS-->>S: 200 resuelta
  end
